      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> The attached product-info panel confirms denim fabric in a denim-blue wash, giving this set a structured yet easy everyday feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A relaxed matching set for moms, dads, girls, and boys built around one coordinated short-sleeve shirt-and-shorts silhouette.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print reference:</strong> Denim Blue keeps the look clean and versatile, with contrast stitching that helps the set read photo-ready without feeling fussy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Short-sleeve button-up shirt, roomy fit, contrast topstitching, patch-pocket detailing, and matching pull-on shorts. The white tee shown in the photos is styling only and is not included.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold, turn inside out, line dry or tumble low, and avoid bleach. This care line is a conservative inference because the blocked vendor page did not expose wash instructions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Children 1-2Y through 8Y and adults S through 3XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Shoulder (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 1-2 Years</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>9-11.5</td>\n<td>75-85</td>\n<td>74</td>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>34</td>\n<td>38</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>12-14.5</td>\n<td>86-95</td>\n<td>78</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>41</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>15-17.5</td>\n<td>96-105</td>\n<td>82</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>44</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>18-20</td>\n<td>106-115</td>\n<td>86</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>47</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>20.5-22.5</td>\n<td>116-125</td>\n<td>90</td>\n<td>42</td>\n<td>36</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>42</td>\n<td>50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>23-25</td>\n<td>126-135</td>\n<td>94</td>\n<td>43</td>\n<td>38</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>44</td>\n<td>53</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>25.5-30</td>\n<td>136-145</td>\n<td>98</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>102</td>\n<td>46</td>\n<td>56</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult S</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>47.5-52.5</td>\n<td>155-165</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>51</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>110</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult M</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>53-57.5</td>\n<td>160-170</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>50.5</td>\n<td>112</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult L</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>58-65</td>\n<td>165-175</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>114</td>\n<td>58</td>\n<td>69</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>65.5-72.5</td>\n<td>170-180</td>\n<td>118</td>\n<td>55</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>118</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 2XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>73-80</td>\n<td>175-185</td>\n<td>122</td>\n<td>57</td>\n<td>53</td>\n<td>122</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td>74</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adult 3XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>80.5-90</td>\n<td>180-190</td>\n<td>126</td>\n<td>59</td>\n<td>54</td>\n<td>126</td>\n<td>66</td>\n<td>76</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Denim Blue is a clean, easy family look built around one short-sleeve shirt-and-shorts silhouette for both kids and adults. The deep blue wash, oversized patch pockets, and contrast stitching give the set a laid-back denim feel that works for everyday errands, vacation days, and casual photo moments. It reads coordinated without looking too dressy, which makes it useful for families who want one outfit everyone can wear together.</p>\n\n<p>The vendor chart publishes one child ladder and one adult ladder rather than splitting the product into separate mom, dad, girl, and boy tables, so this listing keeps the variant structure honest with Child and Adult size labels instead of inventing extra role-specific rows. Shirt length, chest, shoulder, shorts length, waist, and rise all come from the attached chart, while hip was derived because the source omitted it. The attached fit report supports the relaxed shape across the family: child 120 fit both the boy and girl testers loosely, mom wore S loosely, and dad wore 3XL loosely.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>One coordinated family silhouette:</strong> Matching shirt-and-shorts set for kids and adults in the same denim-blue story.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Contrast-stitch finish:</strong> Visible topstitching and pocket detail add structure and help the set photograph well.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy warm-weather shape:</strong> Short sleeves and shorts keep the set practical for summer travel, theme parks, brunches, and family photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Relaxed fit evidence:</strong> The attached fit report shows the published try-on sizes wearing with a loose, easy shape.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Honest two-piece scope:</strong> This listing covers the denim shirt and matching shorts only; the white tee shown in the photos is not included.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each size you need to build a relaxed family set that keeps everyone coordinated for sunny outings, travel days, and easy picture moments.</p>",
